title: Body and Soul
key: Db
tempo: 66
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, AABA, slow. The A sections are D-flat seen from its two,
// E-flat minor, with a chord on every half bar and a minor two-five to the
// four on the way. The bridge goes up a half step to D for four bars, then
// down a step to C, and its last bar falls C7, B7, Bb7 back to the two.
